{
  "_doc": "Raids and people of the prison (scripts/prison/prison_loot.gd, prison_people.gd). natural: the generator's building kind -> place type. min_places: a raid town always has at least this many places of a type (buildings of the surplus are retagged by a stable hash). rolls: for each place type, what ONE container of it holds: [res, chance, min, max]. kinds: a container kind narrows the rolls (only) or changes a chance (p). names/hints: shown on the raid map. options: the gate's choice (name, place types marked, the shortages it answers). people: the pool of survivors. A town is made with `town_opts`. survivor (fix round 3, people come ONLY by rescue): first = the chance of the first survivor in a raid, extra = [[from raid N, chance], ...] one more each, max, hurt = share that need a med to get up (hurt_hp their hit points), locked = share shut in a room (hold E lock_secs, lock_dead dead stand around), skill = what a person does at the base (people entries).",
